{
  "dom_id": "step-41009",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Expressing the Tangent of an Angle in Terms of a Reference Angle",
  "problem": "What is $\\tan 162^\\circ$ expressed in terms of a reference angle?",
  "worked_solution": "To express $\\tan{162^\\circ}$ in terms of $\\tan\\theta_R,$ we follow three steps:\n\n1\\. Find its reference angle $\\theta_R.$\n\n2\\. Calculate the value of the function for $\\theta_R.$\n\n3\\. Determine whether the resulting value is positive or negative.\n\nFirst, let's draw the angle $162^\\circ$ in the coordinate plane (CAST diagram):\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14225445/assets/578c1aa397751d9cc6497e35443ff7b3508f3126f18c6650a26fbd4e74bde58e.png)\n\n**Step 1**: Since $\\theta = 162^\\circ$ is in the $2$nd quadrant, the reference angle $\\theta_R$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\theta }_{R} & ={180}^{∘}-\\theta  \\\\  & ={180}^{∘}-{162}^{∘} \\\\  & ={18}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Step 2**: The given ratio is $\\tan{162^\\circ}$, and therefore we're interested in $\\tan\\theta_R = \\tan{18^\\circ}.$\n\n**Step 3:** The ratio $\\tan{162^\\circ}$ must be *negative* because the tangent ratio is *always* negative in the $2$nd quadrant. Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\tan 162^\\circ = -\\tan{18^\\circ}.\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-41009\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"41009\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"10822\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-41009\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-13\">Expressing the Tangent of an Angle in Terms of a Reference Angle</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"41009\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n 